    <entry>
      <title>英语词汇札记</title>
      <link href="/2026/09/20/notes-on-English-vocabulary/"/>
      <url>/2026/09/20/notes-on-English-vocabulary/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h4 id="efficacy"><a href="#efficacy" class="headerlink" title="efficacy"></a>efficacy</h4><p>n.[U]（应然的）效力，通常指方法、药物。与 efficiency 效率/效益和 effectiveness （实然的）效果不同。</p><h4 id="amicable"><a href="#amicable" class="headerlink" title="amicable"></a>amicable</h4><p>adj. 友善的，不伤和气的。拉丁语词源 amicus。~ manner/divorces/settlement。</p><h4 id="puerile"><a href="#puerile" class="headerlink" title="puerile"></a>puerile</h4><p>adj. 孩子气的，幼稚的。拉丁语词源 puer。</p><h4 id="magisterial"><a href="#magisterial" class="headerlink" title="magisterial"></a>magisterial</h4><p>adj. 权威的；或傲慢的，居高临下的。拉丁语词源 magister。~ presence/work。</p><h4 id="pulchritude"><a href="#pulchritude" class="headerlink" title="pulchritude"></a>pulchritude</h4><p>n.[U] （尤指女性）美丽的。拉丁语词源 pulcher。</p><p>pulchritudinous adj.。</p><h4 id="relinquish"><a href="#relinquish" class="headerlink" title="relinquish"></a>relinquish</h4><p>v.[T] 放弃（责任等）；（不情愿地）松开，交出。拉丁语词源 relinquō。~ claim/control (to)/hold/grip (on)。</p><h4 id="interrogate"><a href="#interrogate" class="headerlink" title="interrogate"></a>interrogate</h4><p>v.[T] 审问，讯问；（计算机）查询。拉丁语词源 interrogō。~ a database。</p><p>interrogation n. subjected to ~。</p><h4 id="magistrate"><a href="#magistrate" class="headerlink" title="magistrate"></a>magistrate</h4><p>n.[C] 地方法官（审理较轻微案件）。拉丁语词源 magistrātus。before the magistrates。</p><h4 id="mutualistic"><a href="#mutualistic" class="headerlink" title="mutualistic"></a>mutualistic</h4><p>adj. （生物）互助的，互惠共生的。</p><p>mutualism n.[U]。</p>]]></content>
      
      
