    <entry>
      <title>线性映射的像与原像</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/22/images-and-preimages-of-linear-maps/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/22/images-and-preimages-of-linear-maps/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>任何一个映射 <script type="math/tex">f:X\to Y</script> 都引出两个基本对象，对 <script type="math/tex">A\subseteq X</script> 的<strong>像</strong> <script type="math/tex">f(A)</script> 与对 <script type="math/tex">B\subseteq Y</script> 的<strong>原像</strong> <script type="math/tex">f^{-1}(B)</script>。对于线性映射 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A:X\to Y</script>，对应研究<strong>子空间</strong> <script type="math/tex">V\subseteq X</script> 的像 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A(V)</script> 与子空间 <script type="math/tex">W\subseteq Y</script> 的原像 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A^{-1}(W)</script>。</p><p>对原像的研究从单点的原像开始，即<strong>纤维</strong>。考虑 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A\boldsymbol x_1=\mathcal A\boldsymbol x_2=\boldsymbol y</script>，有 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A(\boldsymbol x_1-\boldsymbol x_2)=\boldsymbol 0</script>。考察 <script type="math/tex">\boldsymbol 0</script> 处的纤维 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A^{-1}(\{\boldsymbol 0\})</script>，即<strong>核</strong> <script type="math/tex">\ker\mathcal A</script>，它构成了 <script type="math/tex">X</script> 的一个子空间。任取代表元 <script type="math/tex">\boldsymbol x_{\boldsymbol y}\in \mathcal A^{-1}(\{\boldsymbol y\})</script>，就有 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A^{-1}(\{\boldsymbol y\})=\boldsymbol x_{\boldsymbol y}+\ker\mathcal A=\{\boldsymbol x_{\boldsymbol y}+\boldsymbol x:\boldsymbol x\in\ker\mathcal A\}</script>，这一步要求纤维非空，即 <script type="math/tex">\boldsymbol y\in \mathcal A(X)</script>，记<strong>像集</strong> <script type="math/tex">\operatorname{im}\mathcal A= \mathcal A(X)</script>。此时得到<strong>线性映射的任意非空纤维都是核的平移</strong>。</p><p>现在将同一纤维中代表元的选取压缩掉，这归功于 <script type="math/tex">\boldsymbol x_1\sim\boldsymbol x_2\Leftrightarrow\boldsymbol x_1-\boldsymbol x_2\in\ker \mathcal A</script> 给出了一个等价关系，即 <script type="math/tex">[\boldsymbol x]=\boldsymbol x+\ker\mathcal A</script> 给出了一个等价类，每个等价类恰好就是一个非空纤维。所有等价类在 <script type="math/tex">[\boldsymbol x_1]+[\boldsymbol x_2]=[\boldsymbol x_1+\boldsymbol x_2]</script> 与 <script type="math/tex">\lambda[\boldsymbol x]=[\lambda\boldsymbol x]</script> 下自然构成向量空间，记作 <script type="math/tex">X/\ker\mathcal A</script>，称为 <script type="math/tex">X</script> 关于 <script type="math/tex">\ker\mathcal A</script> 的<strong>商空间</strong>，容易看出定义中 <script type="math/tex">\ker \mathcal A</script> 可换作任意子空间得到一般商空间定义。由商空间中元素和纤维的像的对应，即 <script type="math/tex">[\boldsymbol x]\mapsto \mathcal A\boldsymbol x</script>，自然有同构 <script type="math/tex">X/\ker\mathcal A\simeq \operatorname{im}\mathcal A</script>。对任意子空间 <script type="math/tex">W\subseteq Y</script>，考虑限制映射 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A|_{\mathcal A^{-1}(W)}</script>，有 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A^{-1}(W)/\ker \left(\mathcal A|_{\mathcal A^{-1}(W)}\right)\simeq\operatorname{im}\mathcal A|_{\mathcal A^{-1}(W)}</script>，这等价于 <script type="math/tex">\mathcal A^{-1}(W)/\ker \mathcal A\simeq\operatorname{im}\mathcal A\cap W</script>。</p><p>同构的维数公式给出 <script type="math/tex">\dim(\mathcal A^{-1}(W)/\ker \mathcal A)=\dim(\operatorname{im}\mathcal A\cap W)</script>。对商空间 <script type="math/tex">X/U</script>，取 <script type="math/tex">U</script> 的基 <script type="math/tex">\boldsymbol u_1,\cdots,\boldsymbol u_k</script>，扩充为 <script type="math/tex">X</script> 的基 <script type="math/tex">\boldsymbol u_1,\cdots,\boldsymbol u_k,\boldsymbol v_1,\cdots,\boldsymbol v_r</script>，则 <script type="math/tex">[\boldsymbol v_1],\cdots [\boldsymbol v_r]</script> 构成 <script type="math/tex">X/U</script> 的基，故 <script type="math/tex">\dim(X/U)=\dim X-\dim U</script>。由此得 <script type="math/tex">\dim(\mathcal A^{-1}(W))=\dim \ker \mathcal A+\dim(\operatorname{im}\mathcal A\cap W)</script>，特别有 <script type="math/tex">\dim X=\dim \ker\mathcal A+\dim\operatorname{im}\mathcal A</script>。此即<strong>秩-零化度定理</strong>（rank-nullity theorem）。</p>]]></content>
      
      
